      "Microdeletion at chromosome 3q13 detected by chromosomal microarray",
      "FISH or MLPA can confirm deletion"
    ],
    "other": [
      "Developmental and neuropsychological assessments confirm delay",
      "Audiological testing for hearing impairment"
    ]
